      "message": "I think those are different options.\n\nIIUC, IsLLNDK means that the variant is target of LLNDK. This will be set as true with vendor variant of cc_api_library, based on the code https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/vndk.go;l\u003d394 .\n\nHasVendorVariant is for image mutator to check if the module should generate vendor variant. Without this phase, there will be no vendor variant from the cc_api_library module.",
